| #01-12-2006, }Sprint Results}#\n
During the last sprint, enhancements have been made to the %Gfx module and the core module, Most notably to the image classes and the reflection API. A new module for unit testing was added. %Pt::Unit allows protocol- and data-driven testing.

| #01-11-2006, }Scrum project management introduced}#\n
The scrum system can now be used by developers to coordinate their efforts to
improve %Pt. It is not mandatory to take part in the scrum process, but highly
encouraged. Progress can be monitored on the "Project Status" link on the 
%Pt website.

